>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n            十字山农场\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px;'/>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Fausto曾是一名牛奶农户，他的叔叔鼓励他尝试咖啡种植，并给了他最初的Sidra种子，这些种子后来成为了Fausto生产的标志性品种。在他的第一次收获之后，Fausto就爱上了咖啡，并且再也没有回头；2018年，美国的精品咖啡巨头之一的树墩城在厄瓜多尔本国的咖啡生豆金杯竞赛上发现了Fausto的咖啡，从此便开启了Fausto在精品咖啡世界领域的大门，同年，澳洲的精品烘焙商Sample也采购了Fausto的Sidra水洗批次；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          2023年厄瓜多尔CoE竞赛里，Fausto的Sidra水洗获得了第14名；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4sjc6Fyrib2AQQp1zVIJXcz1ZlCbYbtELDFicRmCEQGEnRRCria2udklSw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
